---

The TLS fragment parameters used by this project were derived from
patterniha/Serverless-for-Iran (https://github.com/patterniha/Serverless-for-Iran),
which is licensed GPL-3.0. What was taken is a small set of functional
configuration values, not source code; all installer code in this repository is
original. That project is the reason this one works — see the Credits section of
README.md and docs/how-it-works.md.
